      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  ARPACK DNAUPD/DNEUPD: Implicitly Restarted Arnoldi                      |
      |                  Method (IRAM) for general real non-symmetric                            |
      |                  matrix.                        =============                            |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Computes NEV = 2 eigenvalues of largest magnitude                       |
      |                  (WHICH = LM) and corresponding eigenvectors.                            |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Mode 1: A*x = lambda*x  (standard eigenvalue)                           |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Source: ARPACK-NG 3.9.1                                                 |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  https://github.com/opencollab/arpack-ng                                 |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Documentation: ARPACK Users Guide                                       |
      |                  R.B. Lehoucq, D.C. Sorensen, C. Yang                                    |
      |                  SIAM, Philadelphia, 1998                                                |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                  Suitable for medium full dense and sparse matrices - standard           |
      |                  FEA.                                                                    |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      |                                                                                          |
      +------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
 
 
 
 
            >>>>>     DNAUPD: INFO =            0
            >>>>>     DNAUPD: IPARAM(5) converged Ritz values =            2
 
 
            >>>>>     DNEUPD: IERR =            0
 
 
 
 
      +-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
 
